<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Selamat Wisuda Tahfidz - Nadifa</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;700&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="bg-pattern"></div>

  <main class="card">
    <div class="card-header">
      <div class="ornament">✦</div>
      <div class="graduation-cap">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" width="70" height="70" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill="#f8fafc" d="M32 8L4 22l28 14 28-14-28-14z"/>
          <path fill="#e2e8f0" d="M32 36L4 22v6l28 14 28-14v-6L32 36z"/>
          <path fill="#1a2a4a" d="M54 24v14c0 2-10 6-22 6s-22-4-22-6V24l22 11 22-11z"/>
          <circle cx="54" cy="24" r="3.2" fill="#d4af37"/>
          <path fill="#d4af37" d="M54 27v13" stroke="#d4af37" stroke-width="2.2"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="ornament">✦</div>
    </div>

    <p class="small-label">Wisuda Tahfidz Al-Qur’an</p>
    <h1 class="title">Selamat Wisuda</h1>
    <h2 class="name">Nadifa</h2>

    <div class="divider">
      <span class="line"></span>
      <span class="diamond">◆</span>
      <span class="line"></span>
    </div>

    <p class="message">
      Alhamdulillah, perjalanan panjang menghafal kalamullah telah sampai di titik yang indah ini.
      Semoga setiap ayat yang telah engkau hafal menjadi cahaya di dunia dan syafaat di akhirat.
    </p>

    <div class="highlight-box">
      <p class="highlight-text">
        “Semoga istiqomah terus ya dalam menghafal Al-Qur’an”
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="closing">
      Jaga hafalanmu, teruslah muraja’ah, dan jadilah penjaga Al-Qur’an yang istiqomah.
      <br /><br />
      Barakallahu fiiki, Nadifa ✨
    </p>

    <div class="bottom-decor">
      <div class="quran-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="38" height="38" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect x="8" y="6" width="32" height="36" rx="2.5" fill="#1a2a4a" stroke="#e2e8f0" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <path d="M16 14h16M16 20h16M16 26h12" stroke="#e2e8f0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <path d="M24 6v36" stroke="#e2e8f0" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.45"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p class="from">Dengan doa terbaik</p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <p>Dibuat dengan ❤️ untuk Nadifa</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
:root {
  --dongker: #0f1c33;
  --dongker-light: #1a2a4a;
  --abu-muda: #e8eef5;
  --putih: #f8fafc;
  --accent: #c5d4e8;
  --gold: #d4af37;
  --gold-soft: #e8c96a;
  --text-muted: #a8b8cc;
}

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  min-height: 100vh;
  font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0a1424 0%, #152238 45%, #1c2f4a 100%);
  color: var(--putih);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 40px 20px;
  position: relative;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

.bg-pattern {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(circle at 15% 25%, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.07) 0%, transparent 40%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 85% 75%, rgba(197, 212, 232, 0.06) 0%, transparent 35%);
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 0;
}

.card {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 460px;
  background: linear-gradient(165deg, var(--dongker-light) 0%, var(--dongker) 100%);
  border-radius: 24px;
  padding: 44px 36px 38px;
  box-shadow:
    0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55),
    0 0 0 1px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15),
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  text-align: center;
}

.card-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 18px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.ornament {
  color: var(--gold);
  font-size: 13px;
  opacity: 0.8;
}

.small-label {
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 2.5px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--gold-soft);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.title {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 2.15rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--putih);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
  letter-spacing: 0.3px;
}

.name {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 1.75rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--gold);
  margin-bottom: 22px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.divider {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.divider .line {
  height: 1px;
  width: 55px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
}

.divider .diamond {
  color: var(--gold);
  font-size: 9px;
}

.message {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 300;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--accent);
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.highlight-box {
  background: rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.25);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 20px 22px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
  position: relative;
}

.highlight-box::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 36px;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--gold);
  border-radius: 2px;
}

.highlight-text {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 1.12rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--putih);
  line-height: 1.55;
  font-style: italic;
}

.closing {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  font-weight: 300;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}

.bottom-decor {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding-top: 6px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15);
}

.from {
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.footer {
  margin-top: 26px;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  color: rgba(168, 184, 204, 0.55);
}

@media (max-width: 500px) {
  .card {
    padding: 38px 26px 34px;
  }
  .title {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
  }
  .name {
    font-size: 1.55rem;
  }
}
